{"processInformation": {"dataSetInformation": {"UUID": "4c009f04-44e1-42e3-a32e-4929294debab", "name": {"baseName": [{"value": "Adobe", "lang": "en"}, {"value": "Lehmstein", "lang": "de"}], "functionalUnitFlowProperties": [{"value": "1200 kg/m3", "lang": "en"}]}, "classificationInformation": {"classification": [{"class": [{"value": "Mineralische Baustoffe", "level": 0, "classId": "1"}, {"value": "Steine und Elemente", "level": 1, "classId": "1.3"}, {"value": "Lehmsteine", "level": 2, "classId": "1.3.17"}], "name": "oekobau.dat"}]}, "generalComment": [{"value": "This data set has been modeled according to the European Standard EN 15804+A2 for Sustainable Building. Results are depicted in modules that allow the structured expression of results over the entire life cycle.", "lang": "en"}, {"value": "Dieser Datensatz wurde nach dem European Standard EN 15804+A2 für Nachhaltiges Bauen modelliert. Ergebnisse werden in Modulen abgebildet, die den strukturierten Ausdruck von Ergebnissen über den gesamten Lebenszyklus zulassen.", "lang": "de"}], "other": {"anies": [{"margins": 30, "description": [{"value": "Processes / flows can be missing or estimated. Strongly restricted technological, temporal or geographical representativeness.", "lang": "en"}, {"value": "Wichtige Prozesse/Flüsse können fehlen oder sind abgeschätzt. Stark eingeschränkte technologische, zeitliche oder geographische Repräsentativität.", "lang": "de"}]}]}}, "quantitativeReference": {"referenceToReferenceFlow": [101976], "type": "Reference flow(s)"}, "time": {"referenceYear": 2023, "dataSetValidUntil": 2026, "timeRepresentativenessDescription": [{"value": "Annual average", "lang": "en"}, {"value": "Jährlicher Durchschnitt", "lang": "de"}]}, "geography": {"locationOfOperationSupplyOrProduction": {"descriptionOfRestrictions": [{"value": "The data set represents the country specific situation in Germany, focusing on the main technologies, the region specific characteristics and / or import statistics.", "lang": "en"}, {"value": "Der Datensatz bildet die länderspezifische Situation in Deutschland ab. Dabei werden Haupttechnologien, spezifische regionale Charakteristiken und ggf. Importstatistiken berücksichtigt.", "lang": "de"}], "location": "DE"}}, "technology": {"technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses": [{"value": "The production of adobes covers the process of clay extraction, the mixing, the shaping and the drying. The system boundary of the ready-for-shipment product adobe is represented by the factory gate. Transports from the factory to the building site are not considered and must be included according to the system boundaries.\n\nDuring the disposal phase, manual dismantling is taken into account in Module C1 for plasters, mortar and construction boards made of clay, and a mechanical dismantling for staple walls and clay masonry.\nThe transport in module C2 to the treatment plant takes place with a truck (50km).\nIn module C3 a treatment of the clay product is accounted for, whereby 3% material is lost.\nIn Module D, a credit for the net amount of material (amount recovered minus treatment losses, including possible fiber reinforcements) for the substitution of clay powder.", "lang": "en"}, {"value": "Die Herstellung von Lehmsteinen umfasst die Prozesse der Lehmgewinnung, das Mischen, die Formgebung sowie die Trocknung. Die Systemgrenze bildet das versandfertige Produkt Lehmstein am Werkstor. Transporte vom Werk zur Baustelle sind nicht berücksichtigt und müssen bei Systembetrachtungen eingerechnet werden. \n\nIn der Entsorgungsphase wird in Modul C1 für Putze, Mörtel und Bauplatten aus Lehm ein manueller Rückbau, für Stapflehmwände und Lehmmauerwerk ein maschineller Rückbau berücksichtigt.\nDer Transport in Modul C2 zur Aufbereitungsanlage erfolgt mit einem LKW (50km). \nIn Modul C3 wird eine Aufbereitung des Lehmprodukts bilanziert, wobei 3% Material verloren gehen.\nIn Modul D erfolgt eine Gutschrift für die Netto-Materialmenge (zurückgebaute Menge abzüglich Aufbereitungsverluste, inkl. eventueller Faserbewehrungen) für die Substitution von Lehmpulver.", "lang": "de"}], "technologicalApplicability": [{"value": "This product can be used in construction.", "lang": "en"}, {"value": "Dieses Produkt kann im Baubereich verwendet werden.", "lang": "de"}], "referenceToTechnologyFlowDiagrammOrPicture": [{"shortDescription": [{"value": "construction_de_adobe.jpg", "lang": "en"}], "type": "source data set", "refObjectId": "778b529e-2c45-4b4b-9c52-a895d820523c", "version": "24.01.000", "uri": "../sources/778b529e-2c45-4b4b-9c52-a895d820523c.xml"}]}}, "modellingAndValidation": {"LCIMethodAndAllocation": {"typeOfDataSet": "EPD", "other": {"anies": [{"name": "subType", "value": "generic dataset"}]}}, "dataSourcesTreatmentAndRepresentativeness": {"referenceToDataSource": [{"shortDescription": [{"value": "Homepage Lehmbauwerk, 2008", "lang": "en"}], "type": "source data set", "refObjectId": "84a8ad80-4fd6-4a66-88e8-004de57bbca2", "version": "24.01.000", "uri": "../sources/84a8ad80-4fd6-4a66-88e8-004de57bbca2.xml"}, {"shortDescription": [{"value": "Documentation of data quality management", "lang": "en"}], "type": "source data set", "refObjectId": "e3bd9bbf-2c3c-42aa-8892-fd13f1065ca5", "version": "24.01.000", "uri": "../sources/e3bd9bbf-2c3c-42aa-8892-fd13f1065ca5.xml"}, {"shortDescription": [{"value": "GaBi Database Edition 2021, CUP2021.01", "lang": "en"}], "type": "source data set", "refObjectId": "1cece811-7501-44d4-8067-9259bd5cb835", "version": "00.01.000", "uri": "../sources/1cece811-7501-44d4-8067-9259bd5cb835.xml"}, {"shortDescription": [{"value": "Sphera Managed LCA Content Databases (all versions)", "lang": "en"}], "type": "source data set", "refObjectId": "28d74cc0-db8b-4d7e-bc44-5f6d56ce0c4a", "version": "00.03.002", "uri": "../sources/28d74cc0-db8b-4d7e-bc44-5f6d56ce0c4a.xml"}], "useAdviceForDataSet": [{"value": "The data set represents a cradle to gate inventory. It can be used to characterise the supply chain situation of the respective commodity in a representative manner. Combination with individual unit processes using this commodity enables the generation of user-specific (product) LCAs.", "lang": "en"}, {"value": "Der Datensatz repräsentiert ein Cradle to Gate Inventar. Er kann verwendet werden, um die Lieferkette des jeweiligen Produktes in einer repräsentativen Weise zu charakterisieren. Die Kombination mit einzelnen Einheitenprozessen und diesem Produkt ermöglicht die Erstellung von anwenderspezifischen (Produkt-) LCAs.", "lang": "de"}]}, "validation": {"review": [{"referenceToNameOfReviewerAndInstitution": [{"shortDescription": [{"value": "Sphera Solutions GmbH", "lang": "en"}], "type": "contact data set", "refObjectId": "d7fa0337-f279-430d-becf-7f3111a85010", "version": "24.01.000", "uri": "../contacts/d7fa0337-f279-430d-becf-7f3111a85010.xml"}], "type": "Dependent internal review"}, {"referenceToNameOfReviewerAndInstitution": [{"shortDescription": [{"value": "Sphera Product Sustainability user forum", "lang": "en"}], "type": "contact data set", "refObjectId": "8f1306f0-7b83-4f36-a537-aa83f0498266", "version": "24.01.000", "uri": "../contacts/8f1306f0-7b83-4f36-a537-aa83f0498266.xml"}], "type": "Independent external review"}]}, "complianceDeclarations": {"compliance": [{"referenceToComplianceSystem": {"shortDescription": [{"value": "EN 15804+A2 (EF 3.1)", "lang": "de"}, {"value": "EN 15804+A2 (EF 3.1)", "lang": "en"}], "type": "source data set", "refObjectId": "d4aa3ec7-b1d7-4a4a-a6cb-37af88dcc902", "version": "00.01.000", "uri": "../sources/d4aa3ec7-b1d7-4a4a-a6cb-37af88dcc902.xml"}, "approvalOfOverallCompliance": "Fully compliant"}]}}, "administrativeInformation": {"dataGenerator": {"referenceToPersonOrEntityGeneratingTheDataSet": [{"shortDescription": [{"value": "Sphera Solutions GmbH", "lang": "en"}], "type": "contact data set", "refObjectId": "d7fa0337-f279-430d-becf-7f3111a85010", "version": "24.01.000", "uri": "../contacts/d7fa0337-f279-430d-becf-7f3111a85010.xml"